{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37849","headline":"寻白石山人涧 · 许彬","name":"寻白石山人涧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"路穷川岛上，果值古仙家。\n阴洞长鸣磬，石泉寒泛花。\n莓苔深峭壁，烟霭积层崖。\n难见囊中术，人间有岁华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37849.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37849","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}